  "description": "Along a wide navigable canal within the gated embrace of Puerto Aventuras, this residence commands attention with quiet confidence. The air here carries the scent of salt and tropical greenery, while the gentle lull of water against the private dock sets the rhythm of daily life. Few addresses on the Riviera Maya offer such an authentic marriage of architectural refinement and nautical freedom. It is a place where the Caribbean's finest waterfront lifestyle simply unfolds before you.\n\nStep through the solid mahogany doors into a double height foyer, and the home reveals itself in layers of light and texture. Bellagio marble floors stretch beneath soaring ceilings, while a sculptural Art Deco staircase anchors the central living space with quiet drama. Four generous suites, a versatile gym easily imagined as a fifth bedroom, and a ground floor office that converts effortlessly into a sixth, offer a rare flexibility of scale. The gourmet kitchen, outfitted with premium appliances and a discreet walk in pantry, invites both intimate mornings and grand evenings of entertaining.\n\nOutside, the property becomes its own private resort. A mosaic tiled pool curves around an integrated jacuzzi and a shallow lounging shelf, bathed in customizable ambient lighting come evening. Professionally landscaped gardens, a cascading fountain, and an automated irrigation system frame the poolside bar and barbecue area, perfect for long afternoons shared with family and friends. At the water's edge, a professionally engineered 79 foot dock, complete with a Rolec Marina Solutions power pedestal and bidirectional LED lighting, comfortably welcomes a yacht or catamaran up to 70 feet, along with a dedicated jet ski ramp. The home's self sufficient systems, 27 solar panels, a full house Generac backup generator, hurricane resistant openings, and advanced water purification, ensure comfort regardless of circumstance.\n\nLife at Marina Palms extends well beyond the property line. Residents enjoy a short stroll to untouched beaches, a vibrant marina, golf and tennis facilities, and the community's own Central Park, all within a secure, access controlled enclave. Just twenty minutes from Playa del Carmen and an hour from Cancun International Airport, this is a rare offering for those seeking both sanctuary and sound investment on Mexico's most coveted coastline.",
